-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",18,{
[545]="7006EB36\n1\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Urmâkh\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Urmâkh. Urmâkh can be found in Imhûlar, which is within the Ikorbân Valley.\n2\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Urmâkh\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Urmâkh. Urmâkh can be found in Imhûlar, which is within the Ikorbân Valley.\n",
[546]="70052242\n1\tTravel to Rhosgobel\tRhosgobel can be found in Laerlad, in the Vales of Anduin. You should travel to Rhosgobel.\n2\tTravel to Rhosgobel\tRhosgobel can be found in Laerlad, in the Vales of Anduin. You should travel to Rhosgobel.\n3\tTalk to Radagast\tRadagast can be found in Rhosgobel. You should talk to Radagast.\n",
[547]="7005506F\n1\tFind Dolenthol in the Circle of Death\tDolenthol can be found somewhere in the Circle of Death. Candúr has directed you to find Dolenthol in the Circle of Death and join Prince Faramir's company.\n2\tTalk to Dolenthol in the Circle of Death\tDolenthol can be found in the Circle of Death. You should talk to Dolenthol.\n",
[548]="7001931D\n1\tTalk to Laenin the Glade Watcher\030Collect Letter of Commendation\030Talk to Bogi Deepdelver\tDeliver the letter of thanks to Laenin the Glade Watcher in Celondim. Dwalin, the Lord of the Longbeards, sent you a letter of thanks for your efforts against Ivar the Bloodhand. His hope is that this letter will earn you some measure of reward from the Elves or Dwarves.\n",
[549]="70019C1B\n1\tTalk to Postman Newbuck\030Collect Letter of Commendation\030Talk to Constable Thistlewool\tDeliver the letter of thanks to Constable Thistlewool in Archet or Postman Newbuck in Little Delving. Jon Brackenbrook has written a letter on your behalf thanking you for your assistance with the Blackwold brigands who recently assaulted and destroyed much of Archet. He hopes that you will gain some measure of thanks from others.\n",
[550]="70037D71\n1\tPlant Rohirric banners over slain Uruks\tUruks can be found at the Fords of Isen in the western Westfold. You should plant banners in the bodies of Uruks you've killed.\n2\tPlant Rohirric banners over slain Uruks (total: 8)\tUruks can be found at the Fords of Isen in the western Westfold. You should plant banners in the bodies of Uruks you've killed.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated a number of Uruks at the Fords of Isen, and claimed their deaths with proud banners of the Rohirrim. The Fords will not be safe for foes while Rohan endures.\n",
[551]="7006EED7\n1\tSpeak with Nimasi in Kûr Anzar\tSpeak with the scout Nimasi in Kûr Anzar.\n2\tTake the banner Nimasi has brought from the south\tTake the banner Nimasi has brought from the south.\n3\tGive the strange banner to Mizâdi in Kûr Anzar\tGive the strange banner to Mizâdi in Kûr Anzar.\n4\tGet Numûru's opinion on the situation\tGet Numûru's opinion on the situation.\n5\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Kûr Anzar\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Kûr Anzar.\n6\tLet Nimasi know Mizâdi's decision\tLet Nimasi know Mizâdi's decision.\n7\tRelay Nimasi's gratitude to Mizâdi\tRelay Nimasi's gratitude to Mizâdi.\n",
[552]="7006EC19\n1\tTalk to Ikhajât\tIkhajât has offered to whisk you away to the island of Furtherholm, where you should introduce yourself to Khâtaphos.\n2\tTalk to Khâtaphos inside The Cracked Flagon\tIkhajât has whisked you away to the island of Furtherholm, where you should introduce yourself to Khâtaphos.\n",
[553]="70057D2C\n1\tShine the beards of unkempt dwarves in Thorin's Hall (total: 6)\tUnkempt dwarves can be found throughout Thorin's Hall. Skóri has asked you to aid him in shining the beards of his kinfolk so that they might look their best for the celebration of Midsummer.\n2\tTalk to Skóri\tSkóri can be found in Thorin's Hall. You have done your best to shine the beards of unkempt dwarves in Thorin's Hall. You should return to Skóri.\n",
[554]="70057F5A\n1\tTalk to King Aragorn II Elessar\tKing Aragorn II Elessar can be found in the Tower of Ecthelion in Minas Tirith (Midsummer). A Midsummer reveller has suggested that you present yourself to King Aragorn II Elessar before joining in the festivites in Minas Tirith.\n2\tTalk to Merilien in the Court of the Fountain\tMerilien can be found outside the Tower of Ecthelion in the Court of the Fountain in Minas Tirith (Midsummer). King Aragorn II Elessar has asked you to speak to Merilien, a Midsummer wedding-planner overseeing many of the season's festivities.\n",
[555]="7000E5BB\n1\tCollect white furs (total: 10)\030Pick snowdrops (total: 10)\030Deliver the invitation to Ella at Pynti-peldot\tSnowdrops and white furs can be collected at Leijona-kotin, south of Pinja's homestead, which is south-west of Pynti-peldot in Itä-ma. Ella is at Pynti-peldot. Pinja has asked that you gather the winter-blooming snowdrops and white furs for her marriage dress, and that you hand-deliver an important invitation to Ella in Pynti-peldot.\n2\tTalk to Pinja\030Collect White Fur (total: 10)\030Collect Snowdrop (total: 10)\tPinja is at her homestead, south-west of Pynti-peldot. You should return to Pinja with the snowdrops and furs.\n",
[556]="70050E20\n1\tFind the enemies that left these weapons behind\tA mix of Ungoladan and Gundabad weapons are strewn about the ground. It would be beneficial to investigate and discover who was the victor.\n2\tFind the enemies that left these weapons behind\tA mix of Ungoladan and Gundabad weapons are strewn about the ground.\n3\tCompleted\tA mix of Ungoladan and Gundabad weapons are strewn about the ground.\n",
[557]="70000072\n1\tTalk to Leigh Putnam\tLeigh Putnam is in Trestlebridge, in the North Downs. Leigh Putnam has sent out a call for minstrels to aid in lightening the mood of the embattled populace of Trestlebridge.\n2\tTalk to Leigh Putnam and travel with her to a nearby cave\tLeigh Putnam is in Trestlebridge in the North Downs. Leigh Putnam is waiting to speak with you about travelling to a nearby cave to bring hope to the refugees hiding within and perhaps convince them to come to the relative safety of Trestlebridge.\n3\tTalk to Leigh Putnam\tLeigh Putnam is in Trestlebridge. Leigh Putnam is waiting to speak with you about your recent adventure at the cave of refugees from the North Downs.\n",
[558]="7000EA9A\n1\tDefeat the snarling wolverine\tThe snarling wolverine is on a lakeside cliff, off the north-west road from Kauppa-kohta. A snarling wolverine jumped out at Mainio and scared him. He asked you to investigate and make sure the wolverines are not a threat.\n2\tTalk to Mainio\tMainio is at Kauppa-kohta, south of the road. You should return with news of your success against the snarling wolverine.\n",
[559]="700551D3\n1\tAid Dornach and complete 'The Will of Ugrukhôr'\030Aid Dornach and complete 'Tears of Minas Ithil'\tDornach can be found in the Circle of Despair. You are aiding Dornach in securing the Circle of Despair. NOTE: If you lose sight of Dornach, you can summon him to your side with his horn.\n2\tAid Dornach and complete 'Unstilled Waters'\tDornach can be found in the Circle of Despair. You are aiding Dornach in securing the Circle of Despair. NOTE: If you lose sight of Dornach, you can summon him to your side with his horn.\n3\tMeet Dornach in Barad Arthir\tDornach has returned to Barad Arthir. After securing the Circle of Despair, Dornach asked you to meet him and Candúr in Barad Arthir. You should return to them.\n",
[560]="70019D37\n1\tCollect wind-blown pages (total: 5)\tThe five pages of Istarien's letter to Rilhathel can be found on nearby flets and in the area around Istarien. The pages of an embarrassingly private letter Istarien was writing have been scattered onto nearby flets by a mischievous breeze, and she wants you to retrieve them.\n2\tBring the pages of the letter to Istarien\tIstarien is on one of the upper flets of Telain Galadhrim. You have recovered the pages of Istarien's letter and should now return them to her.\n",
[561]="7002C387\n1\tSearch the forest floor for signs of the missing hunter\tSigns of the missing hunter can likely be found north-east of the hunters' camp in Thinglad. You should search the woods around the camp for signs of the missing hunter's passage or indications of where he might have gone.\n2\tTalk to Noriel\tNoriel is nearby and can be summoned by whistle if you have become separated. You should speak with Noriel, your companion on this mission.\n3\tSearch for another sign of the missing hunter\tAnother sign of the missing hunter looks to be not far from the first in Thinglad, just south of that spot. You should search the woods around the camp for signs of the missing hunter's passage or indications of where he might have gone.\n4\tTalk to Noriel\tNoriel is nearby and can be summoned by whistle if you have become separated. You should speak with Noriel, your companion on this mission.\n5\tSearch for signs of the missing hunter\tSigns of the missing hunter can be found near the hunters' camp in Thinglad. You should search the woods around the camp for signs of the missing hunter's passage, or indications of where he might have gone.\n6\tTalk to Noriel\tNoriel is nearby and can be summoned by whistle if you have become separated. You should speak with Noriel, your companion on this mission.\n7\tSearch for the missing hunter\tThe missing hunter is surely nearby, south and east of the hunter's camp in Thinglad. You should search for the missing hunter.\n8\tTalk to Noriel\tNoriel can be summoned by using the Elf-whistle you were given. You should speak with Noriel.\n",
[562]="7000C38E\n1\tFind Aeglas within Goblin-town\tSeek out Aeglas in Goblin-town, to the North of Rivendell, in the Misty Mountains. Glóin explained that Elrond dispatched an Elf to investigate the stirrings of goblins from their mountain stronghold at Goblin-town. Fearing that Aeglas has been captured, he hopes that you may yet find him alive within the depths of the goblin city.\n",
[563]="700596B4\n1\tComplete a mission (quantity: see journal)\tMissions can be completed across Middle-earth. You should complete any mission.\n2\tTalk to Mara Sandydowns\tMara Sandydowns can be found near the entrance to Winter-home. You have completed a mission during the Yule Festival. You should talk to Mara Sandydowns.\n",
[564]="70053F1B\n1\tCollect the missive\tThe missive can be found near Ohtar in Díngarth. You should collect the missive.\n2\tBring the missive to Eärtur in Adambel\tEärtur can be found at Adambel. You should bring the missive to Eärtur.\n",
[565]="7005403E\n1\tCollect the missive\tThe missive can be found near Amroth in Echad-in-Edhil. You should collect the missive.\n2\tBring the missive to Nithi at Barthost\tNithi can be found at Barthost. You should bring the missive to Nithi.\n",
[566]="70053F4F\n1\tCollect the missive\tThe missive can be found near Eärtur in Adambel. You should collect the missive.\n2\tBring the missive to Celeborn in Echad-in-Edhil\tCeleborn can be found at Echad-in-Edhil. You should bring the missive to Celeborn.\n",
[567]="7002ADDC\n1\tFind a pair of mittens in Winter-home\030Find a carrot near the chicken coops\030Gather coal near the servants' oven\030Gather acorns among the trees of Frostbluff (total: 3)\tThe materials you need to replicate Virgil's snowman can be found around Frostbluff. In order to replicate Virgil's snowman, you will need to gather the right materials.\n2\tBuild a mitten-wearing snowman at a snowpile\tThe snowman-field lies outside Winter-home. Now that you have gathered the necessary supplies, you should head out to the field and find a snowpile to build your snowman.\n",
[568]="7002C002\n1\tCollect troll-stone (total: 10)\tTroll-stone can be found throughout the Brown Lands, in the desolation of the Entwives' gardens, and at the Stone-hole, north of Gnarlstump's camp. Gnarlstump has asked you to gather troll-stone so that he can build a memorial to the Entwives.\n2\tBring the troll-stone to Gnarlstump in the Brown Lands\tGnarlstump is at his camp near the desolation of the Entwives' gardens in the Brown Lands. You should bring the troll-stone you collected to Gnarlstump.\n",
[569]="70019D38\n1\tLook into the distance for Amroth\030Find one of the circular docks that extend into the Celebrant\tThe circular docks that extend into the Celebrant can be found south-east of Caras Galadhon, south of Imlad Lalaith. Pennasdir has asked you to stand on one of the circular docks that extend into Celebrant and to look into the distance for Amroth.\n2\tTalk to Pennasdir upon Telain Glorelloth\tPennasdir is on Telain Glorelloth, in Caras Galadhon, north-west of the docks. You have participated in Pennasdir's tradition of looking for Amroth down the Celebrant and should return now to the Elf.\n",
[570]="7006C541\n1\tDefeat Orcs in Maurûsh (total: 16)\tYour mission is to go to Maurûsh and attack the Orcs while they are weakened and prevent them from recovering their strength.\n",
[571]="70046C2D\n1\tTalk to Chan-két Doloi\tChan-két Doloi can be found at Aelin Veren in central North Ithilien. Maendal has asked you to speak with Chan-két Doloi about his knowledge of the Enemy's plans.\n2\tTalk to Maendal\tMaendal can be found at Aelin Veren in central North Ithilien. You have spoken to Chan-két Doloi and should now return to Maendal.\n",
[572]="700360E3\n1\tTalk to Nindorn\tNindorn is at Stonecliff with the other Ents. In the wake of the attack on the White Hand, Barallas has asked that you speak to the other Ents before returning to the refugees of Byre Tor in Balewood.\n2\tTalk to Mossbeard\tMossbeard is at Stonecliff in the Balewood. In the wake of the attack on the White Hand, Barallas has asked that you speak to the other Ents before returning to the refugees of Byre Tor in the Balewood.\n3\tTalk to Barallas\tBarallas is at Stonecliff in the Balewood. After speaking with the other Ents, Barallas has asked to speak with you one more time before sending you on your way out of the forest.\n4\tTalk to Húna\tHúna is in the hidden cave with the other refugees of Byre Tor in southern Balewood. Barallas and the Ents have bid you farewell and offered a suggestion of how to weaken Núrzum for you to share with the Rohirrim of Wildermore. You should now return to the cave where the refugees have taken shelter and have them leave the forest while peace still holds.\n",
[573]="70009790\n1\tTalk to Hemeldir\tHemeldir is at the forges of Rivendell, in the north-west corner of the Vale. Aragorn has decided that the time has come to reforge Narsil, one of the heirlooms of his line and the blade that broke the power of Sauron in the final battle of the Last Alliance during the Second Age.\n2\tTalk to Aragorn in Rivendell\tAragorn is in one of the rooms of the Guest House located south-west of Elrond's house. The Elf-smith Hemeldir told you that without one of the Silithair, any sword forged from the shards of Narsil would be a lesser weapon.\n",
[574]="7002292B\n1\tTalk to Idhrenfair at Echad Idhrenfair\tIdhrenfair is at Echad Idhrenfair in the Gloomglens, north and west of Echad Saeradan. Saeradan has suggested you might help Idhrenfair seek a more secret path southwards.\n",
[575]="7004A384\n1\tClose opened hatchways (total: 8)\tShut any open hatch doors you find, which seem to primarily lie near forgeworks on the northern side of Udûn.\n2\tCompleted\tClosed many hatchways in Udûn.\n",
[576]="700544BA\n1\tGather medicine (total: 6)\tMedicine can be found in Barad Orhant. You should gather medicine for the ailing Rangers.\n2\tSick Rangers can be found in Barad Orhant. You should treat the sick Rangers.\t\n3\tTalk to Arodor in Barad Orhant\tArodor can be found in Barad Orhant. You should talk to Arodor.\n",
})
